{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":33,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":2866,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1850548,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277979,"Name":"dclodge","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1400201010,"LastPoster":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1850548,"PostDate":1400201010,"PostContent":"We are at a stand still on what to do for wedding reception party favors. What are some super ori...","Author":{"Signature":"Perfect Wedding on a Shoestring Budget - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/perfectwedding.pweck.net'>http:\/\/perfectwedding.pweck.net<\/a>","Email":"dclodge66@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.143.183","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400200239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dclodge","Id":277979,"Name":"dclodge","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.143.183","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28bb28a6148580a915717f4b1576b260","RawContent":"We are at a stand still on what to do for wedding reception party favors. What are some super original and creative ideas?","Attachments":[],"Id":1850548,"PostDate":1400201010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are at a stand still on what to do for wedding reception party favors. What are some super original and creative ideas?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Perfect Wedding on a Shoestring Budget - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/perfectwedding.pweck.net'>http:\/\/perfectwedding.pweck.net<\/a>","Email":"dclodge66@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.143.183","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400200239,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dclodge","Id":277979,"Name":"dclodge","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.115.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ef97856cf2b6119e5cfc8addf4347fa","RawContent":"[quote name=\"dclodge\" post=\"1850548\" timestamp=\"1400197410\"]\nWe are at a stand still on what to do for wedding reception party favors. What are some super original and creative ideas?[\/quote]Hello dclodge, \n\nsometimes it really depends on where you are getting married, As a wedding planner in the Riviera Maya we have seen some fun and inexpensive favors.\n\nMaracas are super fun , you can put a little tag with \"shake for a kiss\" \nmini tequila bottles with a thank you note\ntequila shot glass to take shots the entire night\n\nand the lists goes on.\n\nIf you need a list of fun and inexpensive favors please feel free to reach out and  we will be happy to help.\n\nHappy Planning!","Attachments":[],"Id":1850549,"PostDate":1400201389,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>dclodge, on 16 May 2014 - 12:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are at a stand still on what to do for wedding reception party favors. What are some super original and creative ideas?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello dclodge,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>sometimes it really depends on where you are getting married, As a wedding planner in the Riviera Maya we have seen some fun and inexpensive favors.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Maracas are super fun , you can put a little tag with \"shake for a kiss\"\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>mini tequila bottles with a thank you note<\/p>\n<p>tequila shot glass to take shots the entire night<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and the lists goes on.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you need a list of fun and inexpensive favors please feel free to reach out and \u00a0we will be happy to help.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1326857987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.37.216.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cfe2bceb361f389d5541aa7ed543670","RawContent":"I would like some ideas as well","Attachments":[],"Id":1850585,"PostDate":1400213632,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would like some ideas as well\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latanyabryant@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.37.216.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391314404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276443.jpg?_r=1391315507","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tanya81","Id":276443,"Name":"Tanya81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.38.3.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6413117ab4c7bdb0c9a9faf1a78d3f86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Similar to OOT bags... the insight from previous brides is valuable! Can&#039;t wait for more ideas!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851555,"PostDate":1400682961,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Similar to OOT bags... the insight from previous brides is valuable! Can't wait for more ideas!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angela.jackson@urs.com","IpAddress":"208.38.3.13","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1399559909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277894.jpg?_r=1399556581","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"angelajackson","Id":277894,"Name":"angelajackson","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"186.77.133.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1cb09fc1f1a6ba34cd9e1e93c78de3e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think it depends where you are getting married. I am getting married in Nicaragua and I had these maracas made for guest favors, but also to use as escort cards.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74900]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74900]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851564,"PostDate":1400687212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think it depends where you are getting married. I am getting married in Nicaragua and I had these maracas made for guest favors, but also to use as escort cards.<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74900-maracas-with-our-names-and-dates-for-favors\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17646\/sml_gallery_277561_17646_574201.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Maracas with our names and dates for favors'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Maracas with our names and dates for favors' id='sml_image_view_74900' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74900-maracas-with-our-names-and-dates-for-favors\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17646\/sml_gallery_277561_17646_574201.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Maracas with our names and dates for favors'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Maracas with our names and dates for favors' id='sml_image_view_74900' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bel.maria.g@gmail.com","IpAddress":"186.77.139.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397335710,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277561.jpg?_r=1401300550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"cubanaboliviana","Id":277561,"Name":"cubanaboliviana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.246.186.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9317de11badfeefd7b8c1c6538bc2c62","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m ordering rain stick shakers for my guests-&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was originally going to add them to the welcome bag and have it put in the rooms for them before they arrive.. However, I don&#039;t think it would be a great idea to give my guests a tool to summons rain right before my wedding...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1852547,"PostDate":1401377990,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm ordering rain stick shakers for my guests-<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was originally going to add them to the welcome bag and have it put in the rooms for them before they arrive.. However, I don't think it would be a great idea to give my guests a tool to summons rain right before my wedding...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398541937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.102.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ad27d855dc01ee378f4a9e71974ba3b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The little gifts are a great idea and the guests LOVE them!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have seen personalized sandals, maracas, little tequilas, and even little bags of homemade candy, even the BAG was homemade!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think with destination weddings and guests traveling it is always a nice gesture and just one of the small details that go along with a wedding of this style.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone would like a few ideas that our brides have used in the past we are always available to chat. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1854178,"PostDate":1402080242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The little gifts are a great idea and the guests LOVE them!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have seen personalized sandals, maracas, little tequilas, and even little bags of homemade candy, even the BAG was homemade!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think with destination weddings and guests traveling it is always a nice gesture and just one of the small details that go along with a wedding of this style.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone would like a few ideas that our brides have used in the past we are always available to chat. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<strong class='bbc'><em class='bbc'><span style='color: #696969'>iWedding Mexico <\/span><\/em><\/strong><span style='color: #696969'>takes the stress out of wedding planning! Always available and ready to help you achieve your dream wedding in paradise!<\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: #000000'>iWedding Mexico, Playa del Carmen<\/span><\/span><\/strong><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 12px;'>daniela@iweddingmexico.com<\/span><br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.iweddingmexico.com'>http:\/\/www.iweddingmexico.com<\/a><\/span><\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<strong class='bbc'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>xoxoxo<\/span><\/strong>","Email":"daniela@iweddingmexico.com","IpAddress":"187.153.148.127","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1397244195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277556.png?_r=1402077292","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"iWeddingMexico","Id":277556,"Name":"iWeddingMexico","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.116.131","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"996557bae9993967e19316f8132be2df","RawContent":"Ahhhhhh favors! T minus 109 days!\n\n\n\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1854209,"PostDate":1402098108,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ahhhhhh favors! T minus 109 days!<br><br><br>\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">trishhh. <\/span><3\u00a0<span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">Now Jade, 09.23.2014<\/span>","Email":"patricia_ladd@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.186.69.44","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382752474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274569.jpg?_r=1402198559","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"A7Xtrish","Id":274569,"Name":"A7Xtrish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.188.148.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by A7Xtrish, 08 June 2014 - 04:29 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1402201791,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba7a7f89869c4bb3db9245f01844e360","RawContent":"Thought I&#039;d share (: cute idea.. ! \n\n\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk\nStill learning this new galaxy phone.  I&#039;ve had an iPhone forever gr! For those who cannot view any attachments: \n&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/153014170\/beach-key-chain-beach-wedding-favor-may\"&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/153014170\/beach-key-chain-beach-wedding-favor-may&lt;\/a&gt;\n\n\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1854286,"PostDate":1402201952,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thought I'd share (: cute idea.. ! <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1854286]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-274569-140219813224.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1402198131860.jpg - Size: 63.55KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-274569-140219813224.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1402198131860.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk<br \/>Still learning this new galaxy phone.  I've had an iPhone forever gr! For those who cannot view any attachments: <br><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/153014170\/beach-key-chain-beach-wedding-favor-may' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...dding-favor-may<\/a><br><br>\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">trishhh. <\/span><3\u00a0<span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">Now Jade, 09.23.2014<\/span>","Email":"patricia_ladd@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.186.69.44","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382752474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274569.jpg?_r=1402198559","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"A7Xtrish","Id":274569,"Name":"A7Xtrish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6299dfa6792c44d37953d225634082f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We got mood color changing stadium cups personalized to our names &amp;amp; in our wedding colors. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;ll be handy for guests on the resort, since we&#039;re going to an AI, which tend to have small drink glasses!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found them on Etsy and Ebay (same seller, same price lol). &amp;nbsp;I ordered via Etsy because I could convo them that way, versus email :) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is a link to the cups:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/188014426\/16-oz-custom-mood-cups-clipart-1214-eat?ref=shop_home_feat_1&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/188014426\/16-oz-custom-mood-cups-clipart-1214-eat?ref=shop_home_feat_1&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855120,"PostDate":1402694154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We got mood color changing stadium cups personalized to our names & in our wedding colors. \u00a0It'll be handy for guests on the resort, since we're going to an AI, which tend to have small drink glasses!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found them on Etsy and Ebay (same seller, same price lol). \u00a0I ordered via Etsy because I could convo them that way, versus email <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/><p><strong>Here is a link to the cups:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/188014426\/16-oz-custom-mood-cups-clipart-1214-eat?ref=shop_home_feat_1' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...hop_home_feat_1<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387588652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77073","Title":"Creative Wedding Reception Favors?","LastPostDate":1433258783},"Pages":{"TotalItems":33,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
